      {
        "id": 137237,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-23T13:55:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My only alteration to what you are saying Foote, is that many teams can alter their core with that last pick, letting you counter pick their team with a cohesive team of your own.</p><p>Side note: &nbsp;I'm running champion bot a lot right now, and I am in love with a swift bot to champion bot rush that sets up Tachyon for a wicked opening turn. &nbsp;Scored 2 incapps on my teams second turn that way.</p><p>Next game they banned tach so we champ-turret-BST rushed them with brisk effulgence. &nbsp;Omnitron was our third, so it was ugly.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:13:34.083Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
