      {
        "id": 137240,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-23T19:15:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The terms still work, they just apply better to characters that can't change drastically after selection.</p><p>Like you can tech Baron to counter Legacy, but what you are actually doing is teching disruptor to galvanize/presence, and secondarily teching sabre/redistributor to his all adjacent damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
